    "pve": {
      "en": "Spell. Create a Bed of Coals at target foe's location. For 5 seconds, foes adjacent to target foe are struck for 5...24...29 fire damage each second. Any foe knocked down on the Bed of Coals is set on fire for 3...6...7 seconds.",
      "zhTW": "在目前所在地點創造燒炭地床。持續10秒，使站立在接近燒炭地床位置的敵人每秒受到 5～29 火焰傷害。而且任何敵人在燒炭地床上被擊倒的敵人，將遭受「著火」病症 3～7 秒。"
    },
